  "solution": "BODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nGiven equation: (228 Q 12) S 69 P 3 S (216 Q 18) R 10 S 30 P 4 = ?\n\nLogic: Decode symbols: Q = ÷, S = +, P = ×, R = −.\n\nNow, \n\n(228 ÷ 12) + 69 × 3 + (216 ÷ 18) − 10 + 30 × 4\n\n⇒ __**(228 ÷ 12)**__+ __**69 × **____**3**__ + (__**216 ÷ **____**18)**__−10 + __**30 × 4**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 19 + 207 + 12 − 10 + 120 \n\n= **348 **\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
